      "message": "clearing the enc_buffer might be an issue. Before the template unlock flow, we upload the encrypted templates once when user logs in then continue to use them for each auth. But we call GetNonce for each auth. If GetNonce clears the enc_buffer, there\u0027ll be no template to use for the authenticate.",
